        "original_id": "64366058-e28c-5ac6-8a72-439da186310e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: NBA 2K16, NBA 2K17\n- People: Tony Parker, Dennis Schröder, Marc Gasol, Pau Gasol\n- Companies: Take-Two Interactive, 2K Games, Social Point\n- Organizations: San Antonio Spurs, Atlanta Hawks, Memphis Grizzlies, Chicago Bulls\n- Concepts: point guard position, NBA 2K franchise\n\nFacts:\n- NBA 2K17 is the 18th installment in the NBA 2K franchise and is the successor to NBA 2K16.\n- The French version of NBA 2K16 features Tony Parker of the San Antonio Spurs as the cover athlete.\n- The German version of NBA 2K16 features Dennis Schröder of the Atlanta Hawks as the cover athlete.\n- The Spanish version of NBA 2K16 features Marc Gasol of the Memphis Grizzlies and Pau Gasol of the Chicago Bulls as cover athletes.\n- Dennis Schröder plays the point guard position.\n- Take-Two Interactive owns 2K Games.\n- Take-Two Interactive publishes 2K Sports titles through 2K Games.\n- Take-Two Interactive creates free-to-play mobile titles through Social Point.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
